obs TAME style bans clean; width-check exit 0; living-docs lint GREEN (advisory only). Every function carries contract asserts with positive // invariant comments; every loop names its bound (k rows, l columns, 256 coefficients, at most omega hint positions); a malformed hint is refused before any arithmetic. The verify function calls no std.crypto; only the selftest invokes Zig as the parity oracle.
